(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF MSME) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: PRIME MINISTER EMPLOYMENT GENERATION PROGRAMME \(PMEGP\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(To generate continuous self-employment opportunities for micro enterprises in rural and urban areas.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Any individual above 18 years of age is eligible to apply.) Tj
T*
(2. Minimum VIII standard pass required for manufacturing projects above Rs 10 Lakh.) Tj
T*
(3. Only new greenfield enterprises are eligible for initial funding.) Tj
T*
(4. Self Help Groups \(SHGs\) and Charitable Trusts are also eligible.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Margin money subsidy of 35 % margin money subsidy for rural special categories.) Tj
T*
(2. General category gets 15 percent urban and 25 percent rural subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum project cost cap is Rs 50 Lakh for manufacturing and Rs 20 Lakh for services.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Documents Required:) Tj
T*
(1. Aadhaar Card and PAN Card) Tj
T*
(2. Detailed Project Report \(DPR\)) Tj
T*
(3. Educational Marksheet \(Class 8th Certificate\)) Tj
T*
(4. Special Category / Caste Certificate if applicable) Tj
T*
(5. Gram Panchayat Rural Certificate) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
